<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif', position: 'relative' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 1280, height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 60px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>并发防超订：只允许一条预约成功</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#BFD0EA' }}>03 · 详细设计</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 112, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 360, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 90, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>1</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>条有效预约</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>50 个线程同一秒抢同一房间同一时段</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 380, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 90, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>49</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>条明确失败</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>全部返回 409 与占用时段，不是超时或静默失败</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 400, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 90, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>253<span style={{ fontSize: 28 }}>µs</span></Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>校正 SQL 耗时</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>原全表扫描 3632µs，加日期条件走 range，约 14 倍</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 386, width: 560, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>怎么测的</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>脚本用 Barrier 让 50 个线程真正同时起跑，目标日期由环境变量指定；跑完核对库内记录数与状态分布，原始响应逐条留档。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 660, top: 386, width: 560, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>为什么不会超订</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>行锁让判定串行，后到事务必然看到已提交记录；失败载荷只回真正重叠的时段，不再把当天全部占用一起返回。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 552, width: 1160, height: 66, background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 24px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230' }}>索引改造的等价性由 CHECK 约束 ck_reservation_date_match 保证：reserve_date 必等于 start_time 的日期，加条件不改结果集。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 660, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>智能会议室管理系统 V1.0 · 第 4 组答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>07 / 10</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
